## Brand Design System

### Colors (always use these token names in Tailwind)
- `brand-black` (#0A0A0A) — primary background
- `brand-white` (#F5F3EF) — warm white text
- `brand-cream` (#EDE8DF) — light section backgrounds
- `brand-gold` (#C9A96E) — primary accent, CTAs, highlights
- `brand-gold-light` (#E8D5A8) — subtle gold tints
- `brand-charcoal` (#1A1A1A) — card backgrounds
- `brand-muted` (#6B6560) — secondary text
- `brand-border` (#2A2A2A) — borders, dividers

### Fonts
- `font-display` = Cormorant Garamond (headlines, editorial)
- `font-body` = DM Sans (body text, UI)
- `font-mono` = DM Mono (labels, tags, counters, categories)

### Typography Patterns
```tsx
// Hero headline
className="font-display text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[10vw] font-light tracking-wide leading-none"

// Section heading
className="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-wide"

// Body text
className="font-body text-base text-brand-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-prose"

// Category label / tag
className="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-gold"

// Large decorative number
className="font-mono text-[20vw] font-light text-brand-white/5 select-none pointer-events-none"
```

### Button Patterns
```tsx
// Primary CTA
className="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border border-brand-gold text-brand-gold font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-brand-gold hover:text-brand-black transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"

// Ghost
className="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border border-brand-white/30 text-brand-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:border-brand-white transition-all duration-300"
```

