## Folder Structure
```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx           ← Root layout: fonts, providers, Navbar, Footer
│   ├── page.tsx             ← Homepage
│   ├── globals.css          ← CSS variables, Tailwind base, font imports
│   ├── collections/page.tsx
│   ├── collections/[slug]/page.tsx
│   ├── products/[slug]/page.tsx
│   ├── fabrics/page.tsx
│   ├── tailoring/page.tsx
│   ├── about/page.tsx
│   └── contact/page.tsx
├── components/
│   ├── layout/              ← Navbar, Footer, PageTransition
│   ├── sections/            ← Hero, Collections, HorizontalScroll, Stats, etc.
│   ├── ui/                  ← AnimatedText, MagneticButton, CustomCursor, Marquee
│   └── providers/           ← SmoothScroll (Lenis + GSAP ticker)
├── data/
│   ├── products.ts
│   ├── collections.ts
│   ├── fabrics.ts
│   └── testimonials.ts
├── hooks/                   ← useScrollProgress, useTextScramble, useMagneticEffect
├── lib/
│   ├── gsap.ts              ← gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger)
│   └── utils.ts             ← cn() helper
└── types/index.ts           ← Product, Collection, Fabric, Testimonial interfaces
```

