## next.config.js (Required for static export)
```js
const nextConfig = {
  output: 'export',
  trailingSlash: true,
  images: { unoptimized: true }
}
```

---

## Contact Form (No backend — use Formspree)
```tsx
<form action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_ID" method="POST">
  <input name="name" type="text" required />
  <input name="email" type="email" required />
  <textarea name="message" required />
  <button type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
```

---

## Debug Checklist
- GSAP not working → check `'use client'`, check `ScrollTrigger` registered, check Lenis connected to ticker
- Hydration error → move window/document into useEffect
- Build fails → check `output: 'export'` and `images: { unoptimized: true }` in next.config.js
- Tailwind color not working → check `tailwind.config.ts` has the brand colors in `extend.colors`
- Images broken → paths must start with `/`, must be inside `/public/`
